---
import { BRAND } from '../lib/brand';
import { BUSINESS_CONTACT } from '../lib/businessContact';
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
---
<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-15" title="Grievance redressal" summary="Shikayat aur uski jaanch ka prastaavit tareeqa yahan padhein." review={true} related={[{"href":"/intermediary-policy","label":"Intermediary & content policy"},{"href":"/privacy","label":"Privacy policy"},{"href":"/terms","label":"Terms of use"}]}>
<h2>How to complain</h2>
<p>A page or report form is not confirmation that a complaint has been submitted or received. You can email a complaint to the grievance contact below.</p>
<h2>Grievance contact</h2>
<p><strong>Business name:</strong> {BUSINESS_CONTACT.name}<br /><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.emails.grievance}`}>{BRAND.emails.grievance}</a><br /><strong>Public postal address:</strong> {BUSINESS_CONTACT.postalAddress}</p>
<h2>What a complaint should include</h2>
<p>Include your registered contact details, the relevant profile, call ID or payment reference, date and time, the issue, and the outcome you are asking for. Do not send passwords, OTPs, UPI PINs or Aadhaar numbers. The <a href="/report">report page</a> explains call-safety reporting.</p>
<h2>How we review</h2>
<p>Complaints may concern conduct, a block or strike, a suspension or ban, charges, or deletion. We check the relevant call, billing, and moderation records and communicate the outcome. Pending reports are not the same as confirmed strikes. Self-harm mentions are for welfare follow-up, not a strike.</p>
<h2>Escalation and urgent help</h2>
<p>Nothing here limits your legal remedies. For immediate danger, use the <a href="/emergency">emergency support page</a>; platform reports are not an emergency response service.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
